  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing Misinformation in Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In todays interconnected world, information pollution - the spread of false, misleading, manipulated and otherwise harmful information - poses a profound threat which is further exacerbated during times of crises, where misinformation can spread rapidly, amplifying fear, confusion, and distrust in official sources of information. Against this backdrop, UNDP aims to establish a comprehensive framework to combat and reduce the prevalence of misinformation and information pollution in Egypt through enhancing media literacy among the population and fostering a culture of constructive dialogue</narrative>
  </description>
